WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:09.140 --> 00:00:10.180
[NIKO] Reinforcements!

00:00:10.360 --> 00:00:10.980
[FREDDIE] One second!

00:00:11.240 --> 00:00:12.080
[NIKO] We don't have one second!

00:00:22.860 --> 00:00:23.360
I'm out!

00:00:24.240 --> 00:00:24.920
[FREDDIE] Twinsies...

00:00:25.360 --> 00:00:25.940
Reloading!

00:00:31.960 --> 00:00:33.420
[NIKO] ReeeeeLOADING!

00:00:59.520 --> 00:01:00.080
[FREDDIE] I'm out!

00:01:00.080 --> 00:01:03.780
*Does that gun has extended magazines?*

00:01:05.240 --> 00:01:05.860
Looks like...

00:01:05.920 --> 00:01:06.480
I'M out!

00:01:28.780 --> 00:01:29.920
[BAD GUY] What are you guys doing?

00:01:35.700 --> 00:01:36.900
Ah, shit! I'm out!

00:01:40.260 --> 00:01:42.280
N-No! W-w-wait!

00:01:52.480 --> 00:01:53.880
[JEMMA] Hey, a little help?

00:02:04.220 --> 00:02:04.720
*Click!*

00:02:27.420 --> 00:02:29.980
*Oh crap! Is that D?!"

00:02:32.540 --> 00:02:33.160
[DANIEL] You ready...

00:02:36.620 --> 00:02:37.820
...to get smoked?

00:03:33.420 --> 00:03:34.220
[JEMMA] Take me with you.

00:03:35.100 --> 00:03:36.860
[DANIEL] Oh, uh, I'm actually the bad guy.

00:03:37.100 --> 00:03:38.360
[JEMMA] Whatever, bad boy.

00:03:41.180 --> 00:03:41.900
Wooo!

00:03:47.860 --> 00:03:48.820
[NIKO] That was amazing!

00:03:49.260 --> 00:03:49.760
[FREDDIE] *Sniff*

00:03:51.740 --> 00:03:52.820
[NIKO] Dude, are you crying?

00:03:53.260 --> 00:03:53.760
[FREDDIE] No...

00:03:54.400 --> 00:03:55.120
No, you're crying!

00:04:00.220 --> 00:04:04.740
I feel like this year, this video and the other videos we've put out have been some of the best videos we've made on Youtube.

00:04:04.740 --> 00:04:06.460
So if you're not subscribed to the Corridor channel,

00:04:06.460 --> 00:04:07.900
consider doing so.

00:04:07.900 --> 00:04:13.280
And Freddie, thank you for collaborating with us man. It's been like 8 years and we haven't officially collaborated until now!

00:04:13.860 --> 00:04:15.000
And look at the magic we made.

00:04:15.220 --> 00:04:16.200
Let's do it again!

00:04:16.520 --> 00:04:17.260
Thanks for watching!

